      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<section class=\"blog-template\" aria-labelledby=\"blog-title\">\n  <header><p>每周精选</p><h2 id=\"blog-title\">最新文章</h2><span>关注工程实践、产品方法与设计趋势。</span></header>\n  <div class=\"blog-template__grid\">\n    <article><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b1/640/400\" alt=\"电脑屏幕上的前端代码\"><div><span class=\"blog-template__tag\">技术</span><h3><a href=\"#article-vue\">Vue 组合式 API 实战指南</a></h3><p>从旧写法平滑迁移到组合式 API 的路径与常见问题。</p><small>张伟 · 8 分钟阅读</small></div></article>\n    <article><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b2/640/400\" alt=\"设计师桌上的配色卡片\"><div><span class=\"blog-template__tag\">设计</span><h3><a href=\"#article-design\">界面设计中的信息层次</a></h3><p>用更少的元素建立更清楚的阅读路径和操作重点。</p><small>李娜 · 6 分钟阅读</small></div></article>\n    <article><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b3/640/400\" alt=\"团队围绕白板讨论产品\"><div><span class=\"blog-template__tag\">产品</span><h3><a href=\"#article-product\">如何验证一个产品假设</a></h3><p>从问题、证据到实验，建立可复盘的验证闭环。</p><small>王强 · 10 分钟阅读</small></div></article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.blog-template { box-sizing: border-box; padding: 72px 24px; color: #0f172a; background: #ffffff; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.blog-template > header { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 38px; text-align: center; }\n.blog-template > header p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #4f46e5; font-weight: 700; }\n.blog-template h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }\n.blog-template > header span { display: block; margin-top: 12px; color: #64748b; }\n.blog-template__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.blog-template article { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 18px; background: #ffffff; }\n.blog-template article > img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; }\n.blog-template article > div { padding: 22px; }\n.blog-template__tag { display: inline-block; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; color: #4338ca; background: #eef2ff; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }\n.blog-template h3 { margin: 14px 0 10px; line-height: 1.4; }\n.blog-template h3 a { color: #0f172a; text-decoration: none; }\n.blog-template article p { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.65; }\n.blog-template small { color: #64748b; }\n.blog-template a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #818cf8; outline-offset: 3px; }\n</style>\n"
    }
